[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3520272387","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112645#issuecomment-3520272387","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112645","id":3520272387,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7R0xgD","user":{"login":"Rindbee","id":30386067,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzg2MDY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30386067?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee","html_url":"https://github.com/Rindbee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-12T06:33:28Z","updated_at":"2025-11-12T06:35:35Z","body":"The custom loader and/or saver must extend `ResourceFormatLoader`/`ResourceFormatSaver` and must be a `tool` (for run in editor) script.\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/e47fb8b8989fd5589c65c4b0ac980de2e936c041/editor/file_system/editor_file_system.cpp#L2173-L2179\n\nIt's rather strange that it doesn't need to be a `tool` script when the editor is first (re)started.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3520272387/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3521370870","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112645#issuecomment-3521370870","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112645","id":3521370870,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7R49r2","user":{"login":"ElvisVilla","id":37193450,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MTkzNDUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37193450?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ElvisVilla","html_url":"https://github.com/ElvisVilla","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ElvisVilla/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ElvisVilla/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ElvisVilla/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ElvisVilla/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ElvisVilla/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ElvisVilla/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ElvisVilla/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ElvisVilla/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ElvisVilla/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-12T11:04:49Z","updated_at":"2025-11-12T11:07:34Z","body":"Ok, that I didn’t know 🤔, gonna give it a try with @tool.\n\nEdit: Using tool in the ResourceFormatSaver and Loaded is not specify in the documentation tho. In your end, did that fixed the issue? ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3521370870/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3521524695","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112645#issuecomment-3521524695","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112645","id":3521524695,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7R5jPX","user":{"login":"Rindbee","id":30386067,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzg2MDY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30386067?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee","html_url":"https://github.com/Rindbee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-12T11:46:17Z","updated_at":"2025-11-12T11:46:17Z","body":"Because you intend to use it in the editor. If you only intend to use it at runtime, you don't need to add the `@tool` annotation.\n\nCreating a global script class using `class_name` will actually automatically add a loader/saver instance. The design intent appears to be to allow the editor to automatically manage instance reloading (remove and add), but a new full scan should be triggered after the reload, but it doesn't.\n\nAdding manually will create a new instance, and including the one added automatically, there will be a total of 2 instances. \n\n\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3521524695/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3522212924","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112645#issuecomment-3522212924","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112645","id":3522212924,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7R8LQ8","user":{"login":"ElvisVilla","id":37193450,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MTkzNDUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37193450?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ElvisVilla","html_url":"https://github.com/ElvisVilla","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ElvisVilla/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ElvisVilla/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ElvisVilla/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ElvisVilla/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ElvisVilla/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ElvisVilla/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ElvisVilla/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ElvisVilla/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ElvisVilla/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-12T14:25:32Z","updated_at":"2025-11-12T16:09:42Z","body":"Adding tool to both the ResourceFormatSaver and Loader does fix it, no more ERR_FILE_UNRECOGNIZED = 15, so there is no need to use a hacky solution. Very helpful and good to know, thanks!  ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3522212924/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]